In src/components/ProjectCtaSection.css: immediately before the (now-edited) @media (max-width: 374px) block, insert a new block: '/* 2-column service grid at 375px–480px (was 374px only) */
@media (max-width: 480px) {
  .cta-mobile-services-grid {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 8px;
  }
}'. This places the 480px block before the 374px block, following the project convention of narrowest breakpoints last.
